{
  "_comment": [
    "Rally Madness tuning parts.",
    "A bare number under 'mods' is a multiplier; use {\"add\": n} for an",
    "absolute offset and {\"add\": n, \"mul\": m} for both.",
    "Every part is meant to cost something as well as give something - a big",
    "turbo brings lag, sticky tires wear out, a stripped interior gives up",
    "crash protection. Parts with only upside are a balance bug, not a reward.",
    "min_car_tier gates a part to chassis that can take it; drivetrain_filter",
    "restricts parts that only make sense on one layout."
